From 7ab20b293f94597f45f92923edc8bb250a27220e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Tridgell <andrew@tridgell.net>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 13:40:59 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 028/258] zlib: convert K&R function definitions to ANSI style

The bundled zlib 1.2.8 used K&R-style function definitions which are
rejected by clang 16+ as hard errors. Convert all 90 functions across
9 files to ANSI-style prototypes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
