+			 * entry as a parent of the requested leaf, force the flags back
+			 * to the honest implied-parent encoding (XMIT_TOP_DIR |
+			 * XMIT_NO_CONTENT_DIR) so it lands in FLAG_IMPLIED_DIR, not
