From 49e3dcb10c5aede34240a15229057690e677dd70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Tridgell <andrew@tridgell.net>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 17:17:55 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 099/258] build: add t_rename_secure and t_symlink_secure check
 helpers

