From 26cd6f4c7b5129eec980bbf0ca05b981443eefb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Tridgell <andrew@tridgell.net>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 16:57:56 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 123/258] lib/acl: close the pre-6.13 ACL parent-symlink race
