From 5b0fd12291a152bbcc6103cbd7a8ee7c01e00e45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Tridgell <andrew@tridgell.net>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 12:41:11 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 188/258] backup: fail closed when a symlink target is
